        description="US net international migration fell from 2.7m (2024) to 1.3m (2025) with 0.3m projected for 2026; household formation by recent immigrants is projected to drop from 640,000 (2024) to about 143,000 by 2027, pulling total household growth down to the Joint Center's low series of 690,000 a year (Harvard JCHS, August 2026). Young-adult headship fell to 32.7% in 2024. Household counts drive volume in HCB's North American laundry (all, Persil, Snuggle), dish and Dial body care.",
