        description="The channel is not mature in the US: Walmart US e-commerce grew +24% in the quarter to July 2026 and Amazon's net sales +20% in Q2 2026, while Schwarz Group's online revenue was flat at EUR 1.7bn in FY2025 (continental Europe is maturing, Germany's FMCG online share stays low single digits). Amazon's Alexa for Shopping (May 2026) adds Scheduled Actions (recurring purchases) and Buy for Me; auto-replenishment programmes fix share at the moment of subscription, which is why default status matters more than consideration share in laundry and auto-dish. Amazon is number one in online beauty in eight of ten European countries (NIQ), the entry ramp for every Asian and social-native hair challenger. Loyalty scheme facts have moved: Rewe left Payback in December 2024, Edeka joined in January 2025. Club and big-pack channels in North America (Kirkland Signature about a third of Costco sales) carry lower unit margin and the strongest US private-label vehicle.",
